    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000672_00034",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_6 0, 0, 0}\r",
        "Flick Berries into the mouth of a\n",
        "rotating SWALOT.\r",
        "Score bonus points for getting Berries\n",
        "in consecutively.\r",
        "Score even more during Fever Time.\r",
        "Take deliberate aim or fire randomly--\n",
        "the choice is yours!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_6 0, 0, 0}\r",
        "Jetez des Baies au bon moment\n",
        "dans la bouche d’AVALTOUT.\r",
        "Vous obtiendrez des points bonus si\n",
        "vous lui faites gober plusieurs\f",
        "Baies à la suite.\r",
        "Vous obtiendrez encore plus de points\n",
        "durant le Cycle Bonus.\r",
        "Trouvez le bon équilibre entre\n",
        "vitesse et précision!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000672_00035",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_6 0, 0, 0}\r",
        "Roll a ball while keeping a MIME JR.\n",
        "balanced on top.\r",
        "If the MIME JR. manages to stay on,\n",
        "lights flash and the applause begins.\r",
        "If everyone manages to keep going,\n",
        "the curtains will rise.\r",
        "Try to keep your MIME JR. balanced\n",
        "and on the ball!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_6 0, 0, 0}\r",
        "Faites tourner le ballon de MIME JR.\n",
        "pour l’aider à garder l’équilibre.\r",
        "Si MIME JR. parvient à ne pas tomber,\n",
        "les lumières clignotent et des\f",
        "applaudissements se font entendre.\r",
        "Si tout le monde parvient à garder\n",
        "l’équilibre, le rideau se lève.\r",
        "Ne laissez pas tomber votre MIME JR.!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000672_00036",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_6 0, 0, 0}\r",
        "Press down on the pump from\n",
        "directly above to pump maximum\f",
        "air into a balloon until it pops.\r",
        "Pop balloons until time runs out.\r",
        "Pressing the pump hard will make it\n",
        "turn red, increasing its capacity.\r",
        "The circling WYNAUT can also help.\r",
        "Line a WYNAUT up with the pump to\n",
        "boost the air volume, but beware:\r",
        "lining up the pump with a skinny\n",
        "WYNAUT reduces the air volume.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_6 0, 0, 0}\r",
        "Pompez bien droit pour insuffler autant\n",
        "d’air que possible dans le ballon pour\f",
        "qu’il éclate.\r",
        "Faites éclater des ballons\n",
        "jusqu’à la fin de la partie.\r",
        "Si vous pompez correctement, la pompe\n",
        "devient rouge et est plus efficace.\r",
        "Les OKEOKE peuvent aussi vous aider si\n",
        "vous pompez quand l’un d’eux est sur\f",
        "l’arrivée d’air.\r",
        "Méfiez-vous des OKEOKE trop maigres...\r"
      ]
    }
